<title>USA: Dublin City SD, Ohio, yields 5.426 pct in 2014.</title>
<headline>Dublin City SD, Ohio, yields 5.426 pct in 2014.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ohio Company said it tentatively priced $25 million of Dublin City School District, Ohio, unlimited tax current interest and capital appreciation school building construction and improvement bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.426 percent in 2014.</p>
